        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function template parses the compiler-specific <computeroutput>__PRETTY_FUNCTION__</computeroutput> macro to extract a concise type name for the template parameter <computeroutput>T</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>The implementation is compiler-dependent and may require adjustment for different toolchains. It is primarily intended for internal use within the µTest++ framework to support improved diagnostics and reporting.</para>
